  "details": "# Issue:\n\nIn the Quick Menu Notification Tab you have a small red dot that indicates when ever you have a new Notification in one of the 4 different Notification Categories. (See Attachment Nr. 1 below). With the newly added Group Category it has been hard to identify to that Category the dot belongs to. A Group Notification could also be interpreted as a new Friend Request (See Attachment Nr. 1 below).\n\n# Suggestion: \n\nMove the Notification Dot closer to the actual Text of that Category so it's clear to what Notification Category it belongs to. (See Attachment Nr. 2 below)\n\n# Attachments:\n\nThe first picture shows how it currently looks, and the second picture shows where I could imagine it being moved to:",
